"reset changes."
msgstr "顯示頁面上的所有題目。此操作不會重新載入頁面或儲存或重設更改。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/HelpFiles/InstructorPGProblemEditor.html.ep:152
msgid ""
"Render or re-render the problem, course info file, or set header being "
"edited. This does not change the permanent file on the disk. You can view "
"different versions of the same problem by changing the seed. You can also "
"change the manner in which the mathematics is typeset. If \"Open in new "
"window\" is checked, then the problem will open in a new tab or window "
"showing the problem as it will be rendered for students in the set."
msgstr "顯示或重新顯示正在編輯的題目、課程資訊檔案或作業標頭。此操作不會更改磁碟上的永久檔案。你可以透過更改種子,查看同一題目的不同版本。你亦可以更改數學排版的方式。如勾選「在新視窗開啟」,該題目將在新分頁或視窗中開啟,顯示該題目在作業中呈現給學生的樣式。"

