msgstr "選擇要刪除的課程。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/HelpFiles/AdminDeleteCourse.html.ep:5
msgid ""
"Select a course to delete.  Warning, all data will be deleted and this "
"cannot be undone.  This will not delete any course archives."
msgstr "選擇要刪除的課程。警告,所有資料將被刪除,此操作無法復原。此操作不會刪除任何課程封存檔。"

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/ContentGenerator/CourseAdmin/rename_course_form.html.ep:14
msgid ""
"Select a course to rename.  The courseID is used in the url and can only "
"contain alphanumeric characters and underscores. The course title appears on"
